==Battleground==
*5 [[Zomboe]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Dogenstein]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Oldstrich]] spawns as the boss.
**8 [[Zigge]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**1 [[THE SLOTH]] spawns.

==Strategy==
This stage introduces Oldstrich, who is [[R.Ost]] but on crack. Oldstrich can quickly become a menace with the right support, which he has on later stages. [[Shigong Cat]] can be used to stall him, although he's still vulnerable to Toxic. [[Housewife Cat]] is able to do heavy damage to Oldstrich, especially if she hits a Savage Blow with her [[Talents|Talent]], and [[Fried Chicken Cat]], even with the debuff resistance granted by Oldstrich's [[:Category:Sage Enemies|Sage]] type, still has 73% Curse uptime, which helps to keep your meatshields alive longer.

For this stage specifically, it's simply a race to kill Oldstrich before THE SLOTH kills your army. Bring meatshields, [[Can Can Cat]], and [[Jelly Dumpling Cat]] for Dogenstein. Ideally, you want to prevent the Zigges' burrows through pure force since they spawn faster than your [[Ototo Corps#Holy Blast|Holy Blast]] can unburrow them, and letting a Zigge hit your stack equals disaster.

