==Trivia==
*Fleming Seaway may be named after [[wikipedia:John Ambrose Fleming|John Ambrose Fleming]] or [[wikipedia:Alexander Fleming|Alexander Fleming]]. The word フレミング ''Furemingu'' (Fleming) in its Japanese name can also be taken as "Flemming", as in [[wikipedia:Walther Flemming|Walther Flemming]].

